• 원문(치앙마이주 홍보사무소: 축제 기획자 과정 2기(2026-09-30)): https://chiangmai.prd.go.th/th/content/category/detail/id/9/iid/546853
• 원문(치앙마이주 홍보사무소: 축제 기획자 과정 3기(2026-10-07)): https://chiangmai.prd.go.th/th/content/category/detail/id/9/iid/548913
