• 원문(태국관광청(TAT) ''TAT and Tripadvisor partner to support Thailand''s 2027 tourism transformation'' (2026-10-14)): https://www.tatnews.org/2026/10/tat-and-tripadvisor-partner-to-support-thailands-2027-tourism-transformation/
